    "betaEmailCurrent": "ModuloHTML nativo Formspree mgaarvej fornito dal titolare. Boxwhite +blackbutton unchanged. AJAXconfirmedoktrue openspublicdownloads; network/HTTP/timeout12s/error preserves email and retry. Real submission not tested; feedbackTally unchanged.",
